      "writtenOn": "2022-09-12T06:58:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I agree, not ready seems not accurate.\nBut there is not really good fit from bt_status_t. I picked BT_STATUS_UNHANDLED, which is more or less better than BT_STATUS_FAIL, which provides nothing more.\n\nWhat do you think?",
