      "writtenOn": "2022-09-12T06:58:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Agree BT_STATUS_RMT_DEV_DOWN is bad. \nI vote for BT_STATUS_UNHANDLED to express that the request was not handled. Or shall we just use BT_STATUS_FAIL here? \nWhat do you think?",
